{
  "title": "二次函数求最小值",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "scene_id": 1,
      "speech": "同学们好，今天我们来求函数 f(x) = x² - 2x + 1 的最小值。这个函数看起来是一个二次函数，让我们先来识别它的特点。",
      "instructions": [
        {
          "type": "write_tex",
          "content": "f(x) = x^2 - 2x + 1",
          "position": [
            -3,
            1,
            0
          ],
          "color": "white"
        },
        {
          "type": "write_text",
          "content": "识别：二次函数，a = 1 > 0，开口向上，有最小值",
          "position": [
            -3,
            -0.5,
            0
          ],
          "color": "yellow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 2,
      "speech": "现在我们用配方法来求最小值。将 x² - 2x 配成完全平方，加上再减去 1。",
      "instructions": [
        {
          "type": "write_tex",
          "content": "f(x) = x^2 - 2x + 1",
          "position": [
            -3,
            1,
            0
          ],
          "color": "white"
        },
        {
          "type": "transform_tex",
          "from_tex": "f(x) = x^2 - 2x + 1",
          "to_tex": "f(x) = (x^2 - 2x + 1) = (x - 1)^2",
          "position": [
            -3,
            1,
            0
          ],
          "color": "green"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 3,
      "speech": "配方完成，得到 f(x) = (x - 1)²。接下来我们画出这个函数的图像，直观看出最小值的位置。",
      "instructions": [
        {
          "type": "draw_axes",
          "x_range": [
            -1,
            4,
            1
          ],
          "y_range": [
            -1,
            5,
            1
          ],
          "position": [
            0,
            -2,
            0
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "plot_function",
          "expr": "(x-1)**2",
          "color": "blue",
          "x_range": [
            -0.5,
            3.5
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "mark_point",
          "x": 1,
          "y": 0,
          "label": "顶点(1, 0)",
          "color": "red"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 4,
      "speech": "从图像可以看出，这是一个开口向上的抛物线，顶点就是最低点。当 x = 1 时，(x - 1)² = 0，所以最小值是 0。",
      "instructions": [
        {
          "type": "write_tex",
          "content": "\\text{当 } x = 1 \\text{ 时}",
          "position": [
            -3,
            -1,
            0
          ],
          "color": "white"
        },
        {
          "type": "write_tex",
          "content": "f(x)_{min} = (1-1)^2 = 0",
          "position": [
            -3,
            -2,
            0
          ],
          "color": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "write_text",
          "content": "答案：最小值为 0",
          "position": [
            -3,
            -3,
            0
          ],
          "color": "yellow"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}